{"ID":"20240118144957-krh4mnc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144957-krh4mnc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144957-krh4mnc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144957-o05oc3k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170011-k9adwr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170011-k9adwr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:135,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:135\u0026#125;","title":"370补13没药","type":"doc","updated":"20240204163159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144957-o05oc3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144957-o05oc3k","updated":"20240122165948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国南部热地，为树中流出之脂液，凝结成塽[shuǎng]者，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165952-qxmtvw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165952-qxmtvw9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165954-nuad7t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165954-nuad7t6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】没药为散血消肿定痛生肌要药，主破血止痛，治折伤瘀血，消肿毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165955-67n9dl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165955-67n9dl2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【开宝】主破血止痛，疗金疮杖疮，诸恶疮，痔瘘，卒下血，目中翳晕痛肤赤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165957-2yjpc7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165957-2yjpc7t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【李珣】堕胎，产后心腹血气痛，并入丸散服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165958-cs3a1r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165958-cs3a1r2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】破症瘕宿血，损伤瘀血，消肿痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165959-oaq1key","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165959-oaq1key"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】心胆虚，肝血不足。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170001-5zlj7db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170001-5zlj7db"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170002-yye5bj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170002-yye5bj9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡骨节痛，胸腹胁肋痛，非由血瘀而由血虚者，产后恶露去多，腹中虚痛者，痈疽已溃者，目赤肤翳非血热甚者均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170004-90dkdin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170004-90dkdin"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【吴克潜】打扑跌损，皆伤筋络，气血不行，瘀痈作痛，乳香没药，皆能止痛消肿生肌，故二药多相兼而用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165948-emrdhh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165948-emrdhh8"}},{"ID":"20240122170005-fh3cxoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170005-fh3cxoj"}},{"ID":"20240122170005-6dp6ra6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170005-6dp6ra6","updated":"20240204163123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十三没药，十四乳香，这两个呢都是树脂树里面的脂。这个没药呢，那这个没（mo）药呢当然是没（mei)药啦，没（mei)药就是没（mo），读破音字念mo，你不会去打个没（mo）嘛，打字的时候注音打个没（mo）你就打没（mei)嘛，破音字是没（mo），那这个药呢是树里面流出来的汁液，味苦辛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没药呢是散血消肿定痛生肌的很重要的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以诸位前面学过很多外科使用的药，比如说我们前面介绍丹皮也可以使用桃仁有没有。消肿散积这个很多药都可以，没药也是活血化瘀的药，那一般来说我们会用到没药。十三没药，十四是乳香，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会用到这个药一般来说都是伤科，跌打损伤，骨头骨折了脱臼了肌肉拉伤了我们都会使用，里面内出血都会使用没药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你说【开宝】它说那个止痛主要是破血止痛，疗金疮杖疮有没有，跌打损伤嘛眼睛的刺痛统统可以，那当然啦那个我们身体里面有淤血，长久的淤血所以我们在活血化瘀，在治疗癌症的时候我们也会用到一些像没药，它有止痛的效果在里面，止痛生肌，像我们的金铃子，我们的延胡索没药乳香，这些都有镇痛的效果在里面，镇痛的效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170011-k9adwr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170011-k9adwr8","updated":"20240204163159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个【好古】呢他说这个没药心胆虚，就是心胆虚的人呢就是病人比较胆小常常有焦虑，郑重焦虑的现象，肝血不足的人呢一定会失眠睡觉睡的不好，我们人能眠按照内经里面人能眠因为血能归肝，魂藏在血里面，血能够入肝以后我们才能够睡觉你肝血不足的话你的魂呢失守，没有办法留在肝里面所以人就会失眠，这个时候肝血不足有失眠的现象，就会产生失眠这个时候我们是使用没药的时机。"}]}]}